1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:03,390
(Sheldon:)It'd be swell
if they had a train.

2
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,600
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Penny.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,970
(Penny:)No problem.

4
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,510
(Penny:)So, Leonard,

5
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:16,570
(Penny:)I think it's interesting
you didn't call your girlfriend

6
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:17,780
(Penny:)to come get you.

7
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:20,240
(Leonard:)Uh, I kind of
told her I was working.

8
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:22,080
(Penny:)So you lied to her.

9
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,950
(Penny:)Also interesting.

10
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,700
(Leonard:)Yeah, she doesn't really
understand

11
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:28,650
(Leonard:)the whole Warcraft
adventure-role-playing thing.

12
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:32,320
(Penny:)Well, doesn't matter if she gets
it, as long as she's pretty.

13
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:35,990
(Howard:)This one's funny,
Leonard.

14
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:38,430
(Howard:)How come you couldn't
make it work with her?

15
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,200
(Penny:)So did you at least get
Sheldon's fake stuff back?

16
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,500
(Sheldon:)No. We failed
in our noble quest.

17
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,550
(Penny:)How come?

18
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:50,110
(Sheldon:)Todd Zarnecki was mean.

19
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,640
(Penny:)All right. Hang on.

20
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,080
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

21
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:56,110
(Penny:)I'm gonna show you how we
finish a quest in Nebraska.

22
00:00:57,850 --> 00:01:02,020
(Penny:)Oh. Beyonce.

